Review Board Scheduler for Windows
Copyright 2026 David Norman

This product is a C#/.NET port of the Review Board Scheduler
(github.com/deekayen/eagleboards-java), a Java application reconstructed by
decompiling a pre-existing application received only as a compiled JAR. The
board-scheduling logic, data file formats and check-in web pages here derive
from that project and, through it, from the original author's work. The Java
project's PROVENANCE.md records the reconstruction method and the checksum of
the original artifact.

